          ],
          "content": "国家自然科学基金资助项目结题/成果报告"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.07,
            0.211,
            0.089
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "项目摘要"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.093,
            0.199,
            0.11
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "中文摘要:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.111,
            0.889,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "本课题聚焦在大数据环境下如何改进Brandt et al. (2009)提出的参数化投资组合方法，并准确估计该方法选出的特征变量在随机贴现因子中的风险载荷。课题的意义体现在三个方面:一是构造特征变量的样条函数将非线性预测结构加入投资权重的参数化模型中，使用自适应组LASSO方法估计模型参数，并应用中美股票市场的数据进行实证检验，比较加入非线性特征变量的投资组合的样本外收益是否显著优于传统线性模型。二是提出全子集组合估计法来估计参数化组合模型，该方法允许在大数据环境下考虑更广义的，如CRRA、CARA等期望效用函数，从而解决了LASSO等线性机器学习方法在求解参数化组合模型时只适用于均值方差效用函数的不足之处。三是在投资组合优化中发现的具有解释力的特征变量是潜在的定价因子，我们运用自纠偏机器学习法和样本分割来消除遗漏变量偏误和过拟合偏误，进一步准确估计这些变量在随机贴现因子中的载荷。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.371,
            0.2,
            0.388
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Abstract:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.387,
            0.887,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": "This research project focuses on improving the parametric portfolio policy proposed by Brandt et al. (2009) under big data scenario and on how to precisely estimate the SDF loadings associated with the characteristics that are deemed to be important pricing factors by the parametric portfolio method. Specifically, we aim to contribute to the literature in the following three aspects. First, we incorporate nonlinearity in the parametric portfolio weight function by introducing higher-order splines and estimate the optimal weights using adaptiye group LASSO method when the number of characteristics being considered is very large. Second, we propose a novel parametric portfolio strategy over individual stocks based on subset combination of a large number of characteristics documented to predict returns. The main advantage of the subset combination method is that it allows for the usage of more general utility functions, such as the CRRA and CARA utilities, while other regression-based machine learning methods are only applicable under the mean-variance utility. Third, we employ the automatic debiased machine learning (Auto-DML) method proposed by Chernozhukov et al. (2020) to precisely estimate the SDF loadings of those characteristics that are identified to be potential pricing factors by the parametric portfolio method. This Auto-DML method, along with sample splitting, provides an automatic device to reduce estimation error when the SDF modelling involves omitted variable bias and over-fitting bias."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.826,
            0.827,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "关键词（用分号分开）:投资组合；收益率；大数据；机器学习；定价因子"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.858,
            0.858,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": "Keywords (separated by;): portfolio choice; returns; big data; machine learning; pricing factors"
        },
